{"id":"umbrella-tree-strawberry","name":{"en":"Umbrella Tree Strawberry","ja":"おおがさ木イチゴ","sc":"大伞木莓","tc":"大傘木莓"},"desc":{"en":"This strawberry is a special product of certain regions. The big, hard umbrella protecting the fruit is a unique feature. While they aren't very sweet, it's said they can be fermented into alcohol.","ja":"一部の地域で特産物になっているイチゴ。果実を守る傘の部分が大きく、固いのが特徴。甘味はほとんどないが、発酵させるとお酒の元になるらしい"},"level":10,"slots":2,"evalue":20,"water":true,"wind":true,"effect":70,"kind":"Material","locations":[{"id":"woods-of-eternal-night","name":{"en":"Woods of Eternal Night","ja":"常夜林道"},"parent":"baskes-region"},{"id":"the-furthest-village","name":{"en":"The Furthest Village","ja":"最果て集落"},"parent":"eastern-continent"},{"id":"herb-garden","name":{"en":"Herb Garden","ja":"地下薬草園"},"parent":"eastern-continent"},{"id":"herb-garden-depths","name":{"en":"Herb Garden - Depths","ja":"地下薬草園・深層"},"parent":"eastern-continent"}],"properties":[{"id":"fixed-healing-enhance-plus","name":{"en":"Fixed Healing Enhance+","ja":"回復固定強化＋"},"desc":{"en":"Effect: Enhances healing items by a fixed amount. Weaker power results in stronger enhancement.","ja":"効果：回復アイテムが固定値で少し強化される。元の威力が弱いほど効果は高い"}}],"categories":[{"id":"aroma","name":{"en":"(Aroma)","ja":"（香り）"},"icon":"category-aroma"},{"id":"fruit","name":{"en":"(Fruit)","ja":"（果物）"},"icon":"category-fruit"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"category-plant"}],"index":14,"enum":"ITEM_MAT_OOGASA_STRAWBERRY"}